;; tags: int-arith, bitwise
;; expect: 8
;; Bitwise AND on two GPRs. AArch64 has both register-form (AND Xd, Xn, Xm)
;; and a logical-immediate form with the bitmask encoding -- this test
;; intentionally uses two register operands so the simple form is exercised.
(defun main ()
  (format #t "~D~%" (logand #xFC #x0A)))
